      text: <p><span style="color:#153C2E;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Learn in the field</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#153C2E;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Start with the place, the people and the behavior the program hopes to change.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#153C2E;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Capture observations before choosing a solution.</span></p>
