      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#153C2E;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Build a small pilot</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#153C2E;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Test one practical intervention with a clear owner, a short timeline and a defined review point.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#153C2E;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Keep the first version easy to revise.</span></p>
